{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23377","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和祝苍华 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和祝苍华","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日居复月诸，环回照下土。\n使我玄云发，化爲素丝缕。\n禀质本羸劣，养生仍莽卤。\n痛饮困连宵，悲吟饥过午。\n遂令头上发，种种无尺五。\n根稀比黍苗，梢细同钗股。\n岂是乏膏沐，非关栉风雨。\n最爲悲伤多，心焦衰落苦。\n余者能有几，落者不可数。\n秃似鹊填河，堕如乌解羽。\n苍华何用祝，苦辞亦休吐。\n匹如剃头僧，岂要巾冠主。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}